{
  "$defs": {
    "CameraParams": {
      "description": "Serializable camera parameters for building a runtime model.",
      "properties": {
        "distortion": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/DistortionParams",
          "description": "Distortion model parameters."
        },
        "intrinsics": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/FxFyCxCy",
          "description": "Pinhole intrinsics (`fx, fy, cx, cy` in pixels)."
        },
        "projection": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/ProjectionParams",
          "description": "Projection model parameters."
        },
        "sensor": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/SensorParams",
          "description": "Sensor model parameters."
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "projection",
        "distortion",
        "sensor",
        "intrinsics"
      ],
      "type": "object"
    },
    "DistortionParams": {
      "description": "Serializable distortion model parameters.",
      "oneOf": [
        {
          "description": "No distortion.",
          "properties": {
            "type": {
              "const": "none",
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "type"
          ],
          "type": "object"
        },
        {
          "description": "Brown-Conrady 5-parameter radial-tangential model.",
          "properties": {
            "iters": {
              "description": "Maximum Newton iterations of [`DistortionModel::undistort`] (0 → 20).",
              "format": "uint32",
              "minimum": 0,
              "type": "integer"
            },
            "k1": {
              "description": "Radial coefficient k1.",
              "format": "double",
              "type": "number"
            },
            "k2": {
              "description": "Radial coefficient k2.",
              "format": "double",
              "type": "number"
            },
            "k3": {
              "description": "Radial coefficient k3.",
              "format": "double",
              "type": "number"
            },
            "p1": {
              "description": "Tangential coefficient p1.",
              "format": "double",
              "type": "number"
            },
            "p2": {
              "description": "Tangential coefficient p2.",
              "format": "double",
              "type": "number"
            },
            "type": {
              "const": "brown_conrady5",
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "type",
            "k1",
            "k2",
            "k3",
            "p1",
            "p2",
            "iters"
          ],
          "type": "object"
        },
        {
          "description": "OpenCV rational polynomial 8-parameter model.",
          "properties": {
            "iters": {
              "description": "Maximum Newton iterations of [`DistortionModel::undistort`] (0 → 20).",
              "format": "uint32",
              "minimum": 0,
              "type": "integer"
            },
            "k1": {
              "description": "Numerator radial coefficient k1.",
              "format": "double",
              "type": "number"
            },
            "k2": {
              "description": "Numerator radial coefficient k2.",
              "format": "double",
              "type": "number"
            },
            "k3": {
              "description": "Numerator radial coefficient k3.",
              "format": "double",
              "type": "number"
            },
            "k4": {
              "description": "Denominator radial coefficient k4.",
              "format": "double",
              "type": "number"
            },
            "k5": {
              "description": "Denominator radial coefficient k5.",
              "format": "double",
              "type": "number"
            },
            "k6": {
              "description": "Denominator radial coefficient k6.",
              "format": "double",
              "type": "number"
            },
            "p1": {
              "description": "Tangential coefficient p1.",
              "format": "double",
              "type": "number"
            },
            "p2": {
              "description": "Tangential coefficient p2.",
              "format": "double",
              "type": "number"
            },
            "type": {
              "const": "rational",
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "type",
            "k1",
            "k2",
            "k3",
            "k4",
            "k5",
            "k6",
            "p1",
            "p2",
            "iters"
          ],
          "type": "object"
        },
        {
          "description": "Brown-Conrady + thin-prism 9-parameter model.",
          "properties": {
            "iters": {
              "description": "Maximum Newton iterations of [`DistortionModel::undistort`] (0 → 20).",
              "format": "uint32",
              "minimum": 0,
              "type": "integer"
            },
            "k1": {
              "description": "Radial coefficient k1.",
              "format": "double",
              "type": "number"
            },
            "k2": {
              "description": "Radial coefficient k2.",
              "format": "double",
              "type": "number"
            },
            "k3": {
              "description": "Radial coefficient k3.",
              "format": "double",
              "type": "number"
            },
            "p1": {
              "description": "Tangential coefficient p1.",
              "format": "double",
              "type": "number"
            },
            "p2": {
              "description": "Tangential coefficient p2.",
              "format": "double",
              "type": "number"
            },
            "s1": {
              "description": "Thin-prism coefficient s1 (x correction, r²).",
              "format": "double",
              "type": "number"
            },
            "s2": {
              "description": "Thin-prism coefficient s2 (x correction, r⁴).",
              "format": "double",
              "type": "number"
            },
            "s3": {
              "description": "Thin-prism coefficient s3 (y correction, r²).",
              "format": "double",
              "type": "number"
            },
            "s4": {
              "description": "Thin-prism coefficient s4 (y correction, r⁴).",
              "format": "double",
              "type": "number"
            },
            "type": {
              "const": "thin_prism",
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "type",
            "k1",
            "k2",
            "k3",
            "p1",
            "p2",
            "s1",
            "s2",
            "s3",
            "s4",
            "iters"
          ],
          "type": "object"
        },
        {
          "description": "Fitzgibbon single-parameter division model.",
          "properties": {
            "lambda": {
              "description": "Division distortion coefficient.",
              "format": "double",
              "type": "number"
            },
            "type": {
              "const": "division",
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "type",
            "lambda"
          ],
          "type": "object"
        },
        {
          "description": "Kannala-Brandt 4-parameter radial polynomial.",
          "properties": {
            "iters": {
              "description": "Maximum Newton iterations of [`DistortionModel::undistort`] (0 → 20).",
              "format": "uint32",
              "minimum": 0,
              "type": "integer"
            },
            "k1": {
              "description": "Coefficient of `r²`.",
              "format": "double",
              "type": "number"
            },
            "k2": {
              "description": "Coefficient of `r⁴`.",
              "format": "double",
              "type": "number"
            },
            "k3": {
              "description": "Coefficient of `r⁶`.",
              "format": "double",
              "type": "number"
            },
            "k4": {
              "description": "Coefficient of `r⁸`.",
              "format": "double",
              "type": "number"
            },
            "type": {
              "const": "kannala_brandt4",
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "type",
            "k1",
            "k2",
            "k3",
            "k4",
            "iters"
          ],
          "type": "object"
        }
      ]
    },
    "FxFyCxCy": {
      "description": "Standard pinhole intrinsics: focal lengths and principal point in pixels.\n\nThe pixel grid is assumed orthogonal, so `K` carries no skew term.",
      "properties": {
        "cx": {
          "description": "Principal point X coordinate in pixels.",
          "format": "double",
          "type": "number"
        },
        "cy": {
          "description": "Principal point Y coordinate in pixels.",
          "format": "double",
          "type": "number"
        },
        "fx": {
          "description": "Focal length in pixels along X.",
          "format": "double",
          "type": "number"
        },
        "fy": {
          "description": "Focal length in pixels along Y.",
          "format": "double",
          "type": "number"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "fx",
        "fy",
        "cx",
        "cy"
      ],
      "type": "object"
    },
    "Iso3Schema": {
      "description": "JSON Schema proxy for [`Iso3`] (`nalgebra::Isometry3<f64>`).\n\n`nalgebra` does not implement [`schemars::JsonSchema`], so `*Export` and\nparameter types that embed [`Iso3`] annotate the field with\n`#[cfg_attr(feature = \"schemars\", schemars(with = \"Iso3Schema\"))]`\n(or `Vec<Iso3Schema>` / `Option<Iso3Schema>`). This proxy mirrors the exact\nserde wire format of `Isometry3`:\n`{ \"rotation\": [qx, qy, qz, qw], \"translation\": [tx, ty, tz] }`.\n\nIt exists only to describe that shape to `schemars`; it is never\nconstructed at runtime.",
      "properties": {
        "rotation": {
          "description": "Unit quaternion `[qx, qy, qz, qw]` (i, j, k, w order).",
          "items": {
            "format": "double",
            "type": "number"
          },
          "maxItems": 4,
          "minItems": 4,
          "type": "array"
        },
        "translation": {
          "description": "Translation `[tx, ty, tz]` in meters.",
          "items": {
            "format": "double",
            "type": "number"
          },
          "maxItems": 3,
          "minItems": 3,
          "type": "array"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "rotation",
        "translation"
      ],
      "type": "object"
    },
    "LaserPlane": {
      "description": "Laser plane in camera frame: unit normal + signed distance.\n\nThe plane equation is: n̂ · p + d = 0\nwhere p is a point in camera coordinates.\n\nA plane is valid by construction: its normal has unit length (within\n`1e-9`) and every value is finite, and a plane read from JSON is checked\nthe same way.",
      "properties": {
        "distance": {
          "description": "Signed distance from camera origin",
          "format": "double",
          "type": "number"
        },
        "normal": {
          "description": "Unit normal vector in camera frame. Serializes as `[nx, ny, nz]`.",
          "items": {
            "format": "double",
            "type": "number"
          },
          "maxItems": 3,
          "minItems": 3,
          "type": "array"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "normal",
        "distance"
      ],
      "type": "object"
    },
    "ProjectionParams": {
      "description": "Serializable projection model parameters.",
      "oneOf": [
        {
          "description": "Classic pinhole model.",
          "properties": {
            "type": {
              "const": "pinhole",
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "type"
          ],
          "type": "object"
        },
        {
          "description": "Equidistant (fisheye) projection.",
          "properties": {
            "type": {
              "const": "equidistant",
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "type"
          ],
          "type": "object"
        }
      ]
    },
    "ScheimpflugParams": {
      "description": "Scheimpflug tilt parameters (OpenCV-compatible).",
      "properties": {
        "tilt_x": {
          "description": "Tilt around X axis in radians (alias: tau_x).",
          "format": "double",
          "type": "number"
        },
        "tilt_y": {
          "description": "Tilt around Y axis in radians (alias: tau_y).",
          "format": "double",
          "type": "number"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "tilt_x",
        "tilt_y"
      ],
      "type": "object"
    },
    "SeedCamera": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "One camera of a [`DeviceSeed`].",
      "properties": {
        "cam_se3_rig": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "$ref": "#/$defs/Iso3Schema"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "description": "Camera-from-rig (`T_C_R`) in the seed's rig frame. Every camera has\none or none does; a seed of one camera without it has the camera's\nframe as its rig frame."
        },
        "id": {
          "description": "The camera's id in the dataset manifest.",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "image_size": {
          "description": "`[width, height]` in pixels of the images the values are for (the\ntile, for a camera that is a region of a larger sensor). A seed for\nanother image size (another binning or region) is for another\ncamera.",
          "items": {
            "format": "uint32",
            "minimum": 0,
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "maxItems": 2,
          "minItems": 2,
          "type": "array"
        },
        "laser_plane": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "$ref": "#/$defs/LaserPlane"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "description": "The camera's laser plane, in the camera's own frame."
        },
        "lens": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/SeedLens",
          "description": "The lens: intrinsics, distortion and sensor tilt."
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "id",
        "image_size",
        "lens"
      ],
      "type": "object"
    },
    "SeedHandeye": {
      "description": "Where a seed's rig sits on the robot, in the seed's rig frame.",
      "oneOf": [
        {
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "description": "The rig rides on the gripper.",
          "properties": {
            "gripper_se3_rig": {
              "$ref": "#/$defs/Iso3Schema",
              "description": "The rig's pose on the gripper (`T_G_R`)."
            },
            "mode": {
              "const": "eye_in_hand",
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "mode",
            "gripper_se3_rig"
          ],
          "type": "object"
        },
        {
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "description": "The rig stands in the robot's base frame.",
          "properties": {
            "mode": {
              "const": "eye_to_hand",
              "type": "string"
            },
            "rig_se3_base": {
              "$ref": "#/$defs/Iso3Schema",
              "description": "The base's pose in the rig (`T_R_B`)."
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "mode",
            "rig_se3_base"
          ],
          "type": "object"
        }
      ]
    },
    "SeedLens": {
      "description": "A seed camera's lens: a whole calibrated camera, or a datasheet's values.",
      "oneOf": [
        {
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "description": "A calibrated camera, whole, in its model: intrinsics, distortion and\nsensor. Its model must be the one the session is configured with: the\nseeded steps refuse a distortion of another kind or a tilt for an\nuntilted camera, and the derivations do not compare the projection.\n[`DeviceSeed::nominal`] keeps only the intrinsics and the tilt, for a\nsession of another model.",
          "properties": {
            "camera": {
              "$ref": "#/$defs/CameraParams",
              "description": "The camera's parameters (a sensor homography is not seedable)."
            },
            "kind": {
              "const": "calibrated",
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "kind",
            "camera"
          ],
          "type": "object"
        },
        {
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "description": "What a datasheet states: the intrinsics and the mount tilt. The\ndistortion is not known and starts at zero; the tilt is the stated\none, zero for a frontal mount.",
          "properties": {
            "intrinsics": {
              "$ref": "#/$defs/FxFyCxCy",
              "description": "Pinhole intrinsics, pixels."
            },
            "kind": {
              "const": "nominal",
              "type": "string"
            },
            "sensor": {
              "$ref": "#/$defs/ScheimpflugParams",
              "description": "Sensor tilt, radians; zero for a frontal mount."
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "kind",
            "intrinsics",
            "sensor"
          ],
          "type": "object"
        }
      ]
    },
    "SensorParams": {
      "description": "Serializable sensor model parameters.",
      "oneOf": [
        {
          "description": "Identity sensor model.",
          "properties": {
            "type": {
              "const": "identity",
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "type"
          ],
          "type": "object"
        },
        {
          "description": "Homography applied in the sensor plane.",
          "properties": {
            "h": {
              "description": "Row-major homography matrix mapping normalized to sensor coordinates.",
              "items": {
                "items": {
                  "format": "double",
                  "type": "number"
                },
                "maxItems": 3,
                "minItems": 3,
                "type": "array"
              },
              "maxItems": 3,
              "minItems": 3,
              "type": "array"
            },
            "type": {
              "const": "homography",
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "type",
            "h"
          ],
          "type": "object"
        },
        {
          "description": "Scheimpflug/tilted sensor model.",
          "properties": {
            "tilt_x": {
              "description": "Tilt around X axis in radians (alias: tau_x).",
              "format": "double",
              "type": "number"
            },
            "tilt_y": {
              "description": "Tilt around Y axis in radians (alias: tau_y).",
              "format": "double",
              "type": "number"
            },
            "type": {
              "const": "scheimpflug",
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "type",
            "tilt_x",
            "tilt_y"
          ],
          "type": "object"
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "description": "The device quantities a calibration starts from, by camera id: a\ndatasheet's nominal values or a previous calibration's estimates.\n\nA seed is an initial value, not a prior, and it carries no uncertainty.\nThe one place it limits a solve is a Scheimpflug sensor's weakly\ndetermined tilt: planar intrinsics refines within bounds around a seeded\ntilt, and a laserline device holds it. It holds what belongs to the hardware:\neach camera's lens, its mount in the rig, its laser plane and the rig's\nhand-eye. Nothing of a capture is in it (no target poses, robot-pose\ncorrections or residuals), and no configuration: the camera model is the\nconfig's, and a calibrated lens must be of that model.\n\nUnits are the pipeline's: pixels, radians and metres. A seed is made by\n[`from_spec`](Self::from_spec) or\n[`from_calibration`](Self::from_calibration), not transcribed by hand;\nits JSON form is how it is stored.\n\nThe rig frame of the mounts and the hand-eye is the seed's own (a\ndrawing's frame, or the reference camera of the run it came from). The\nderivations that take a `reference` camera re-express them so that\ncamera's mount is the identity, as a rig problem's gauge requires; laser\nplanes are in their camera's frame and need no change.",
  "properties": {
    "cameras": {
      "description": "The cameras, ids unique; at least one.",
      "items": {
        "$ref": "#/$defs/SeedCamera"
      },
      "type": "array"
    },
    "description": {
      "description": "Where the seed came from, for its reader.",
      "type": [
        "string",
        "null"
      ]
    },
    "handeye": {
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/SeedHandeye"
        },
        {
          "type": "null"
        }
      ],
      "description": "The rig on the robot, in the seed's rig frame (see\n[`SeedCamera::cam_se3_rig`])."
    },
    "version": {
      "description": "Format version, [`DEVICE_SEED_VERSION`].",
      "format": "uint32",
      "minimum": 0,
      "type": "integer"
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "version",
    "cameras"
  ],
  "title": "DeviceSeed",
  "type": "object"
}
